---
import LocationLayout from '../layouts/LocationLayout.astro';
import { locationsBySlug } from '../data/locations';

const location = locationsBySlug['somerset-county'];
---

<LocationLayout 
  location={location}
  title="Personal Injury Lawyer in Somerset County | Alex Poberesky Law"
  description="Experienced personal injury and criminal defense attorney serving Somerset County, Maryland. Free consultation. Call (410) 484-0400."
>
  <h2>Experienced Legal Representation in Somerset County, Maryland</h2>
  
  <p>
    Somerset County on Maryland's Lower Eastern Shore is a close-knit community centered 
    around Princess Anne and Crisfield. Known for its seafood industry and the University 
    of Maryland Eastern Shore, the county faces unique challenges. Attorney Alex Poberesky 
    provides dedicated legal representation to Somerset County residents.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Personal Injury Cases in Somerset County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Somerset County's economy relies heavily on the seafood industry, particularly the 
    famous Crisfield crab and oyster harvests. Workers in this industry face significant 
    risks. Whether you've been injured in a maritime accident, hurt in a car collision, 
    or suffered harm due to negligence, we can help you seek compensation.
  </p>
  
  <p>We handle personal injury cases throughout Somerset County, including:</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Car accidents on Route 13 and local roads</li>
    <li>Commercial fishing and maritime injuries</li>
    <li>Workplace injuries in seafood processing</li>
    <li>Boating accidents in the Tangier Sound and Chesapeake Bay</li>
    <li>Agricultural accidents</li>
    <li>Slip and fall accidents</li>
    <li>Medical malpractice</li>
    <li>Wrongful death cases</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense in Somerset County</h3>
  
  <p>
    If you're facing criminal charges in Somerset County, you need an experienced attorney 
    who will fight for your rights. We defend clients against DUI charges, drug offenses, 
    assault, theft, and other criminal matters.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Accessible Legal Representation</h3>
  
  <p>
    We understand that Somerset County residents sometimes feel disconnected from legal 
    resources in larger cities. That's why we make the commitment to travel to Princess 
    Anne and throughout the county to meet with clients and appear in court. Quality 
    legal representation should be accessible to everyone.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving All Somerset County Communities</h3>
  
  <p>
    We represent clients throughout Somerset County, including Princess Anne, Crisfield, 
    Marion, Deal Island, Westover, Ewell (Smith Island), and surrounding areas. Contact 
    us today for a free consultation about your case.
  </p>
</LocationLayout>
